### quick Some(User) radio=false
K  list rooms
C  change room
N  new messages
E  enter message
G  next unread
M  go to Mail
W  who's online
Q  log out
H all - help topics
### quick Some(User) radio=true
K  list rooms
C  change room
N  new messages
E  enter message
G  next unread
M  go to Mail
W  who's online
Q  log out
H all - help topics
### all Some(User)
H MAIL — Mail
H READ — Reading
H POST — Posting
H USERS — Users
H NAV — Navigation
H ACCT — Account
### mail Some(User)
Mail (private messages):
M    go to Mail
E    write (prompts)
E @user msg  send inline
N    read new
F/R  older/newer
S    scan
D <#> delete
### read Some(User)
Reading:
N    read new messages
F    forward-read (oldest first)
R    reverse-read (newest first)
S    scan message headers
.FF  fast-forward past unread
### reading Some(User)
Reading:
N    read new messages
F    forward-read (oldest first)
R    reverse-read (newest first)
S    scan message headers
.FF  fast-forward past unread
### post Some(User)
Posting:
D <#>  delete
E      enter message (prompts)
E msg  draft a post (. sends, C cancels)
E @user msg  draft a DM inline
### posting Some(User)
Posting:
D <#>  delete
E      enter message (prompts)
E msg  draft a post (. sends, C cancels)
E @user msg  draft a DM inline
### users Some(User)
Users:
U         list active
U banned  list banned
U all     list all
SEARCH <q> find
WHOIS <u> details
### nav Some(User)
Navigation:
C    change room
G    unread here, else next room
K    list known rooms
M    go to Mail
### navigation Some(User)
Navigation:
C    change room
G    unread here, else next room
K    list known rooms
M    go to Mail
### acct Some(User)
Account:
B      block / unblock a user
PASSWD  change your password
PROFILE edit your display name
Q      log out
W      who's online
H USERS — Users
### account Some(User)
Account:
B      block / unblock a user
PASSWD  change your password
PROFILE edit your display name
Q      log out
W      who's online
H USERS — Users
### aide Some(User)
No help for 'aide'.
H for commands, H reading/posting/navigation/account for topics.
### sysop Some(User)
No help for 'sysop'.
H for commands, H reading/posting/navigation/account for topics.
### h Some(User)
H — show this help
H MAIL/READ/POST/USERS/NAV/ACCT for topics
H <cmd> for detail on one command (eg. H N)
### help Some(User)
H — show this help
H MAIL/READ/POST/USERS/NAV/ACCT for topics
H <cmd> for detail on one command (eg. H N)
### ? Some(User)
H — show this help
H MAIL/READ/POST/USERS/NAV/ACCT for topics
H <cmd> for detail on one command (eg. H N)
### q Some(User)
Q — log out
### register Some(User)
REGISTER <user> — create an account (you'll be prompted for a password).
On a radio you can also do it in one message: REGISTER <user> <password>.
### login Some(User)
LOGIN <user> — log in (you'll be prompted for a password).
On a radio, one message works too: LOGIN <user> <password>.
### cancel Some(User)
CANCEL — cancel the current workflow
### n Some(User)
N — read new messages since last visit
### f Some(User)
F — forward-read (oldest first)
F <id> to start from a specific message
### r Some(User)
R — reverse-read (newest first)
### s Some(User)
S — scan message headers in this room
### search Some(User)
SEARCH <query> — find users by username (substring match)
### .ff Some(User)
.FF — fast-forward past unread
Resets your last-read pointer to the latest message.
### e Some(User)
E — enter a message
E <text> to post without a prompt
In Mail: E @user message
### d Some(User)
D <id> — delete a message
Aides and sysops can delete any message.
### g Some(User)
G — read unread here, else go to the next room with unread
### c Some(User)
C <name> — change room by name or number
### k Some(User)
K — list known rooms
### m Some(User)
M — go to Mail (private messages)
In Mail: E to write, N to read new,
F/R older/newer, S scan, D <#> delete.
H MAIL for full mail help.
### w Some(User)
W — who's online
### b Some(User)
B <user> — block / unblock user
Prefix + to force-block, - to force-unblock, or omit to toggle.
Hides their messages from you.
### profile Some(User)
PROFILE — edit your display name
### passwd Some(User)
PASSWD — change your password
You'll be asked for your current password, then the new one twice.
### stop Some(User)
STOP — stop pending messages
### v Some(User)
No help for 'v'.
H for commands, H reading/posting/navigation/account for topics.
### pending Some(User)
No help for 'pending'.
H for commands, H reading/posting/navigation/account for topics.
### .er Some(User)
No help for '.er'.
H for commands, H reading/posting/navigation/account for topics.
### .eu Some(User)
